OL,3,GNEWSASerious crash closes A5 between
OL,4,AWeedon and Kilsby
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe A5 has been closed in both
OL,7,Fdirections between Weedon and Kilsby,
OL,8,FNorthamptonshire, following a serious
OL,9,Fcollision.
OL,11,FThe fire service said it was shut at
OL,12,Fabout 07:30 BST at Watling Street.
OL,14,FMotorists have been advised to find
OL,15,Falternative routes.
OL,17,FEmergency services remain at the scene.
